    LTEXT           "Download the latest version of iCloud from apple.com (not the Microsoft Store) in order to continue using AltForge Server.\n\nIf you already have iCloud installed, please locate the ""Apple"" folder that was installed along with iCloud. This can normally be found a",IDC_DESCRIPTION,7,7,254,60
END

